### Registreren
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test",
  "email": "test@test.nl",
  "password": "wachtwoord123"
}

### Inloggen (goed wachtwoord)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.nl",
  "password": "wachtwoord123"
}

### Inloggen (fout wachtwoord)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.nl",
  "password": "verkeerd"
}